{"feeds": {"type": "feed", "id": "187347118949140480", "url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "title": "字节跳动技术团队", "description": "字节跳动的技术实践分享\n(wechat feed made by @ttttmr https://wechat2rss.xlab.app)", "siteUrl": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "image": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4Mz0zV5VtfHx3vA6LLNw3npTWibbGbYhtsc131DoN6m0A/0", "errorMessage": null, "errorAt": null, "ownerUserId": null}, "entries": {"feedId": "187347118949140480", "id": "1279050454063357952", "title": "Agent Plan 「Agent云电脑」工具： 让 AI 在云电脑上完成股市深度研究", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247522149&idx=1&sn=383a089a1ed8658ac6742851ca4d4325", "content": "<p><span>Agent Plan</span> <span>2026-09-07 19:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a3df5858&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeevWdz4gUvT8b0PUYK33PZOIbRobmjlpkrv876HpTKiaQUIyNrukYSia3g14PicibdCOvuJeNVYH6fSkqibGcB1wicQH4sQo9CRMwQMY%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>引言</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>你有没有过这样的经历：接到一个深度调研任务，要查行情、翻研报、对数据、写分析，一坐就是大半天，浏览器开了十几个标签页，还得反复切换整理？</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>如果能把这些活儿 \"丢给云端\"，让一台 24 小时在线的云电脑自己拆解任务、检索资料、生成报告，而你只需要最后验收结果 ，将显著提升工作效率。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>今天这篇文章，就来聊聊火山方舟 Agent Plan 里专属 Harness工具「Agent 云电脑」。它不只是一个远程桌面，而是一个自带 agent loop、能自行拆解并执行复杂任务的云端助手。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>核心亮点：</span></strong></span></p></div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>跨网页与桌面操作：</span></strong></span><span> CUA 可以在云桌面中打开网页、使用站内搜索、滚动页面、切换标签页，并处理需要交互的页面。它适合多步 GUI 工作流，不局限于返回搜索摘要。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>一次委派，持续观察：</span></strong></span><span>只创建一次任务，云平台可自动拆解并执行复杂任务。平台可持续监控任务进度，监控任务中断不影响任务执行，可以随时停止和恢复任务监控。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>长程复杂任务自行拆解：</span></strong></span><span> 对于复杂任务，云电脑agent可以自行拆解，充分利用云电脑预装的软件和交互方案，完成复杂任务。</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>我们以 \"做一份股市大盘深度研究\" 为例演示「Agent 云电脑」能力，把复杂调研交给云端，真的可以很简单。</span></p><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>前置准备</span></strong></p></div><p style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>购买套餐：请登陆「火山方舟」或 「官网活动页」，购买Agent Plan套餐</span></strong></p></li></ul><p></p><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>1. 购买Agent Plan套餐</span></strong></p></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>进入 Agent Plan 控制台 购买 Agent Plan 套餐。购买后即可开启使用套餐内专属Harness工具。</span></p><div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);text-align: justify;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>注意：目前Agent 云电脑（Computer Use Agent）当前仅支持在 </span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Large/Max套餐</span></strong><span> 下使用。</span></p></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=06b59437&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FedwzeuEDS9xKUsNicRCgJkSelesJvWQgslhzou4STMedOAcS6QMnQNZZuZdic91thBicRHnJM1VXKibGhpXhVVAqmWQVVk7d3CaXjM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2. 安装并配置skill</span></strong></p></div></div></div><p></p><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Agent 云电脑只使用 Agent Plan 凭证。推荐先用 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 107, 184);background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>arkcli</span></span><span> 安装和配置 skill。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>使用 arkcli 安装和配置（推荐）。</span></strong></span></p></div><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>安装 arkcli</span></p></li></ol><p></p><ul class=\"\"></ul><pre><code><span>npm <span>i</span> <span>@volcengine</span>/ark-cli -g --registry <span>https</span>://registry.npmjs.org</span></code></pre><p></p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\" start=\"2\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>通过 arkcli 配置 agentplan 并安装 cua，其中 profile 选择 agent plan</span></p></li></ol><p></p><ul class=\"\"></ul><pre><code><span>arkcli helper mcp codex <span>--capability</span> cua</span></code></pre><p></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>在 codex 中确认是否已经安装完毕</span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=d1c8bdbf&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeclNjMsEKKtJeEufpfSSlCKcXB0qsKYMu9lF9KreNicJpL3mu1sqqZCn3Rfia2DvhfSmqp3hA3sEr41wF3OQOTLmCbt3NT8T7qxk%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>详细操作指南</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Step1  通过 skill 来发起任务</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Agent 云电脑是一个开箱即用的一个 skill，初次登录时，服务端会给用户分配一个云电脑，后续用户使用同一个 api key 登录时，会复用之前的云电脑机器，因此你可以随时启用云电脑而不必担心配置和安装的软件丢失。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Agent 云电脑自带 agent loop，因此可以不必像传统的 computer use 工具一样，只暴露基础的操作接口，agent需要频繁和云桌面操作，而只需要下达指令即可，Agent 云电脑可以自行拆解复杂任务，并自己驱动执行。</span></p></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=551c7d75&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9Fecnt0LPnsGqMsK4kKLM7wV3YnXdx9JiaJMbGgjCT1dYiclauXr60DtHgX01VNl2icJJkom11S2kFU9MWKpRibuMKx5SEIu7Rj9GvEM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Step2  等待任务执行完成</span></strong></p></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>云电脑的 agent 会自动解析和拆解任务，并且触发云端安装的软件和工具进行资料检索。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=8d0e6389&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9Fed1paAQUlo8eyE3OhqS0njDoSb6nficNvTwKnQlm8IS90PZiccoYFibzGib72pIiaDPFIDYic1kh8hhzb24khwib9d0qctiaaXa3rCZT3k%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>完成资料整理和分析，生成有深度的分析。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 60%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=32245c48&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FeeBaMQMolHKiakPapVHFlB2ZN9EetUftKiawvljjamm9cibw6reFIjiaSBBHnpQak8N92wVanicUh3Q4CEYhmtTVAYJ1Vp4KSGEaRfc%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 40%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 95%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=e43a481e&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FedpnjXMZmunGI6arfmJGe7bGQvWlmNwiaakLNQib1dBicDMVibWhfHAKZNCtyX66NxnBgcib6pKS96FRwjliapibDpqiaRNQ1Z3HapiclXI%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align